{"reviews":[{"id":"B088RMH5CM-0","r":2.0,"t":"Beware of SOL DE JANEIRO Coco Cabana Jet Set","x":"I purchased the SOL DE JANEIRO Coco Cabana Jet Set, having previously purchased the Coco Cabana Cream in the jar and really liking it.  In the set is the jar (which smells great), the spray (also smells fine), and the Moisturizing Body Cream which SMELLS LIKE MOLDY FEET.  OMG!  That ONE item is awful - will have to throw away.  It got OLD...I've had it happen with OLD bath & body works body creams, too.  The smell turns rancid.  Pass up on the SOL DE JANEIRO Coco Cabana Jet Set and stick with th","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-1","r":5.0,"t":"A little bummed","x":"Product smells great. My only issue is with the cream. Seems to have not been securely sealed. Was oozing out of the cap. Consistency of the body cream seems more greasy than a cream","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-2","r":5.0,"t":"First time buying this one... great purchase! Five stars!","x":"Great scent, and I thought it was the same as the yellow one but is not. The coconut scent is a bit to strong, but we live at the beach so we like the scent, the kit is great. Packaging is impecable and just think again is a bit over priced. But not as much as the regular yellow cream. I really like this brand and if you want better quality product you just have to pay a little extra to get the good stuff.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-3","r":1.0,"t":"Smells exactly like buttery popcorn","x":"I wish I did not buy this because I can\u2019t return. Scent is very strong, so strong and sweet could give you a headache. , smells like buttered popcorn candy and NOT in a good way. But if you want to smell like popcorn , buy this .","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-4","r":3.0,"t":"Hint of popcorn...","x":"I can sense a hint of coconut, but I am not happy with the scent. I was hoping for more of a suntan oil scent, and It's just not for me. Too sweet, too something. This may work for some, but I am just not happy with it. Unfortunately this product cannot be returned either, so I'm out the money I paid for it. Keep that in mind, because I was under the impression that I could return it.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-5","r":5.0,"t":"Disappointed","x":"So sad....the cream wasnt full and the shipping sticker was right in the middle of the containers so now have a sticker mark.... Very very disaplointed cause I love sol products this is a first :(","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-6","r":2.0,"t":"Smells like crayons","x":"The product I received has an old crayon smell to it. The body cream felt very sticky afterwards, and the spray isn't great either.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-7","r":3.0,"t":"Good, but spray came empty.","x":"I read how the spray came empty didn\u2019t think it would happen to me but it did","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-8","r":3.0,"t":"Smells wonderful","x":"I adore the scent & it lingers for a good long while. The hand cream has a nice feel & isn't oily, but is only moderately moisturizing. The body wash doesn't lather very well so I need to use a larger amount than other, much less expensive brands I've used. Would only buy again for the unique, long lasting scent","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-9","r":1.0,"t":"Horrible smell","x":"This smells SO STRONG of cocoa butter that it stinks. I'm so unhappy with it and can't even return or exchange. I use Palmer's cocoa butter lotion so I thought that I would like this scent but it just plain stinks to me. For the $26.50 it's quite disappointing :(","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-10","r":3.0,"t":"Meh","x":"I love all things beachy scented. I treated myself to this after seeing so many great reviews. It was ok. The scent is nice but a little off in the lotion. The body spray scent lasts about an hour. I\u2019ll stick with B&BW.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-11","r":3.0,"t":"Smells like praline","x":"Can definitely smell the pralines. I smell like a latte. It is a well packaged set and the zipper bag doubles as a wet swimsuit holder (which I love)! I am not a huge fan of this scent but I would give this as a gift!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-12","r":5.0,"t":"I fell in LOVE...","x":"This product smells amazing and makes your body feel absolutely incredible!! This product made me fall in love! If u want to smell amazing and feel incredible then what are u waiting for go buy in it!!!! Xoxo","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-13","r":3.0,"t":"To each their own.","x":"Got the little set to try. The body butter actually burned going on, the perfume has more of a burnt plastic smell, doesn't last very long, I prefer the original scent and it doesn't burn going on.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-14","r":5.0,"t":"Intoxicating scent","x":"The scent alone is lovely. The fact that just a little bit of the moisturizer goes a long way, makes it a value. I will buy the larger size when Amazon carries it. Hint hint!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-15","r":5.0,"t":"Lush,tranquil and smooth....","x":"Wonderful scent makes one feel as if at the beach with silky-smooth skin. Great for travel or over night... worth the money. One well want to purchase full size!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-16","r":5.0,"t":"Smells great","x":"Smells amazing and fresh. I only get compliments that i smell good. The scent doesn\u2019t fade fast which is great. Little pricey for the size","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-17","r":5.0,"t":"Love!","x":"Love the scent, love the texture, awesome little gift for any woman. Love the little travel bag perfect size for your travel bag or purse.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-18","r":5.0,"t":"Love love love","x":"Everything about this product is perfect. The fragrance and the feel of the lotion after it\u2019s applied. It\u2019s all yummy \ud83d\ude0a","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-19","r":2.0,"t":"Broken Package","x":"Kit was open and did not zip and I purchased it for part of  a bachelorette gift so the gift set thing did not work out","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-20","r":4.0,"t":"More vanilla than beaches.","x":"I was hoping for more of a tropical , beach scent.  This is more vanilla and almond.  Lotion is sticky once it dries.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-21","r":5.0,"t":"Worth it","x":"Worth it value for the money works well see dramatic change in a few days especially on dry hands and feet","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-22","r":5.0,"t":"smells good","x":"smells so good.  makes me want to try another one, bc i LOVE the original bumbum too.  is there a 3rd? =)","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-23","r":1.0,"t":"Poor packing","x":"My product came damaged. the perfume was open and spilt everywhere. This stuff ain\u2019t cheap either.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B088RMH5CM-24","r":5.0,"t":"Love this brand!","x":"Delicious!  This smells the best!  Straight off the beach!  Love this brand and all its products!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers love the scent, describing it as great, amazing, or intoxicating.","cites":[2,3,9,13,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers dislike the scent, comparing it to popcorn, crayons, cocoa butter, or burnt plastic.","cites":[4,5,7,10,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers report packaging or shipping problems, such as leaking, empty spray, or sticker marks.","cites":[2,6,8]},{"text":"A few reviewers find the product overpriced or not worth the money.","cites":[3,10]},{"text":"Some reviewers note the scent is very strong or too sweet.","cites":[3,4,5]}]},"qa":[]}